<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins 2.00-4.00 lower; butts not tested; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs. steady, 20-26 lbs. 1.00-3.00 lower; sdls. bellies 14-16 lbs. mostly 2.00 lower; lean trimmings 1.00-4.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings. -USDA</p>
